# CAXperts: the Shared build output is committed so that this package can be consumed straight from a git URL.
# Upstream expects consumers to run src/DevScripts/build_shared.py first, which a UPM git reference cannot do.
# Regenerate with: dotnet build src/VoltstroStudios.UnityWebBrowser.Shared -c ReleaseUnity -f netstandard2.1
!VoltstroStudios.UnityWebBrowser.Shared.dll
!VoltstroStudios.UnityWebBrowser.Shared.pdb
!VoltstroStudios.UnityWebBrowser.Shared.xml
